e  both going strong into the indefinite  future with the CW announcing that  arrows 8th season will be its last  Oliver Queen on the other hand might not  be so safe even there though it seems  unlikely there are still two more  episodes of arrow scheduled to air after  crisis on Infinite Earths ends and while  one wrap up episode about always pals  dealing with his death would be  understandable two would be pushing it  that doesn't mean they won't pull it off  though stranger things have happened  once you've done an interdimensional  team-up musical nothing's out of the  question  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite DC storylines are coming  soon subscribe to our YouTube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one

